            {
              "_key": "k1",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k2",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Sahil, 25, gets his first lateral offer: ₹12,00,000 CTC from a mid-size IT company in Pune, attached as a one-page \"Annexure A: Compensation Breakup\". Eleven lines, three columns, a total at the bottom. HR wants his acceptance by Friday.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_key": "k3",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k4",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "This lesson walks through that annexure the way a tax-savvy reader would, using everything from the first three chapters. By the end you will have a repeatable method for reading any Indian salary breakup in about 15 minutes.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
